SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 13:03:07 and reappears at 14:35:09 +03\, se
 en from Makkah\, SA.\nThe Moon is 45° up · daylight\, Sun +69°.\nTimes 
 for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon'
 s edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=21.4266&lon=39.8256
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=21.4266&lon=39.8256
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
